<title>UK: Littlewoods wants exculsivity on Freemans.</title>
<headline>Littlewoods wants exculsivity on Freemans.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's largest private company Littlewoods would still be interested in buying the Freemans mail order business of Sears but would only re-enter talks on an exclusive basis, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are still very interested in talking to them about Freemans but only on an exclusive basis,&quot; the spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
